{"pageProps":{"note":{"id":"zettel.20260424010000","title":"Prompt engineering adalah lapisan kontrol pertama untuk LLM","desc":"Prompt adalah alat kontrol yang mengarahkan distribusi probabilitas output LLM, bukan sekadar teks biasa.","updated":1777253882236,"created":1776970133238,"tags":["zettel","prompt-engineering","ai","control"],"custom":{},"fname":"zettel.20260424010000","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"7604861a718e5d8c8dde93e533420824","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.20260424010000","id":"zettel.20260424010000","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.zettel","alias":"zettel","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.zettel"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.20260424010000","id":"zettel.20260424010000","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.prompt-engineering","alias":"prompt-engineering","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.prompt-engineering"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.20260424010000","id":"zettel.20260424010000","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.ai","alias":"ai","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.ai"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.20260424010000","id":"zettel.20260424010000","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.control","alias":"control","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.control"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"zettel.20260424010000","id":"zettel.20260424010000","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"book-summaries.the-developers-guide-to-ai","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":3,"offset":514},"end":{"line":11,"column":48,"offset":559},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"book-summaries.the-developers-guide-to-ai"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"zettel.20260424010000","id":"zettel.20260424010000","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"zettel.moc.ai-native","position":{"start":{"line":12,"column":3,"offset":649},"end":{"line":12,"column":27,"offset":673},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"zettel.moc.ai-native"}}],"anchors":{"relevansi":{"type":"header","text":"Relevansi","value":"relevansi","line":22,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":[],"parent":"zettel","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"prompt-engineering-adalah-lapisan-kontrol-pertama-untuk-llm\">Prompt engineering adalah lapisan kontrol pertama untuk LLM<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#prompt-engineering-adalah-lapisan-kontrol-pertama-untuk-llm\"></a></h1>\n<p>Prompt engineering bukan hanya soal menulis kata-kata yang enak didengar oleh AI. Ini tentang mengarahkan distribusi kemungkinan output model dengan mendesain instruksi, konteks, contoh, query, dan format output.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>model tidak memahami maksud lo; ia hanya melihat token yang lo kirim</li>\n<li>prompt yang vague memberi ruang interpretasi terlalu besar</li>\n<li>prompt yang panjang tidak selalu lebih baik karena context window dan token cost</li>\n<li>prompt adalah artefak desain sistem, bukan sekadar teks perintah</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"relevansi\">Relevansi<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#relevansi\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/book-summaries.the-developers-guide-to-ai\">The Developer's Guide to AI</a> — overview struktur dan level buku sebagai peta praktis AI engineering untuk developer</li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.moc.ai-native\">MOC AI-native engineering</a> — MOC AI-native engineering</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a class=\"color-tag\" style=\"--tag-color: #a03623;\" href=\"/sotoy/notes/tags.zettel\">zettel</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">prompt-engineering (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">ai (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">control (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>","noteIndex":{"id":"root","title":"Hello and Welcome! 👋","desc":"","updated":1778468084907,"created":1724251163400,"tags":["x","twitter"],"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"root","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"fbada016be66dbd4790f7e49ede05b67","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.x","alias":"x","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.x"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.twitter","alias":"twitter","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.twitter"}}],"anchors":{"find-more":{"type":"header","text":"Find More","value":"find-more","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":["book-summaries","daily","handbook","notes","tags","til","zettel"],"parent":null,"data":{},"body":"\nWelcome to the homepage! I use Dendron to store and organize notes, ideas, and experiments I’m working on. Here are the main sections you’ll find on this site:\n\n1. **Learning Notes** — Practical notes on programming, recent technologies, and productivity tips.\n2. **Personal Projects** — Summaries of projects, experiments, and outcomes I’m working on or have completed.\n3. **Writings & Opinions** — Casual articles and reflections about technology, daily life, and other interesting topics.\n\nI’m constantly experimenting and learning. I hope the content here helps you as a reference, a starting point for discussion, or just light reading.\n\n> Why Dendron?\n>\nDendron helps keep notes organized. Its \"seed\" and \"vault\" concepts make it easy to structure content and find what you need.\n\n## Find More\n\nIf you want to learn more or connect, check these links:\n\n- [Homepage (Dendron)](https://zeihanaulia.github.io/sotoy/)\n- [My GitHub](https://github.com/zeihanaulia)\n- [My Twitter / X](https://x.com/zeihanaulia)\n\nThanks for stopping by. If you have feedback or want to chat, feel free to reach out.\n"},"collectionChildren":null,"customHeadContent":null,"config":{"version":5,"dev":{"enablePreviewV2":true},"commands":{"lookup":{"note":{"selectionMode":"extract","confirmVaultOnCreate":true,"vaultSelectionModeOnCreate":"smart","leaveTrace":false,"bubbleUpCreateNew":true,"fuzzThreshold":0.2}},"randomNote":{},"insertNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"none","enableMultiSelect":false},"insertNoteIndex":{"enableMarker":false},"copyNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"title"},"templateHierarchy":"template"},"workspace":{"dendronVersion":"0.83.0","vaults":[{"fsPath":"vault"}],"journal":{"dailyDomain":"daily","name":"journal","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd","addBehavior":"childOfDomain"},"scratch":{"name":"scratch","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd.HHmmss","addBehavior":"asOwnDomain"},"task":{"name":"","dateFormat":"","addBehavior":"childOfCurrent","statusSymbols":{"":" ","wip":"w","done":"x","assigned":"a","moved":"m","blocked":"b","delegated":"l","dropped":"d","pending":"y"},"prioritySymbols":{"H":"high","M":"medium","L":"low"},"todoIntegration":false,"createTaskSelectionType":"selection2link","taskCompleteStatus":["done","x"]},"graph":{"zoomSpeed":1,"createStub":false},"enableAutoCreateOnDefinition":false,"enableXVaultWikiLink":false,"enableRemoteVaultInit":true,"enableUserTags":true,"enableHashTags":true,"workspaceVaultSyncMode":"noCommit","enableAutoFoldFrontmatter":false,"enableEditorDecorations":true,"maxPreviewsCached":10,"maxNoteLength":204800,"seeds":{"dendron.templates":{}},"enableFullHierarchyNoteTitle":false},"preview":{"enableFMTitle":true,"enableNoteTitleForLink":true,"enableFrontmatterTags":true,"enableHashesForFMTags":false,"enablePrettyRefs":true,"enableKatex":true,"automaticallyShowPreview":false},"publishing":{"enableFMTitle":true,"enableNoteTitleForLink":true,"enablePrettyRefs":true,"enableKatex":true,"copyAssets":true,"siteHierarchies":["root"],"writeStubs":true,"siteRootDir":"docs","seo":{"title":"Sotoy","description":"Pe